// DLL Execution Via Register-cimprovider.exe | T1574 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_registry_cimprovider_dll_load.yml
process.executable.caseless:*\\register\-cimprovider.exe AND (process.command_line:*\-path* AND process.command_line:*dll*)
